{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"ef5193a4-64d0-4ddc-99cb-a075e5abcd26","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I've read through the brief and the instructions, and I've drafted and posted Gus Firstpass's initial message to the room. Keeping with Gus's character—an ordinary reader who doesn't use craft vocabulary and simply reads for the story—I've outlined what he's hoping to see regarding voice and pacing in all three sections before anyone begins drafting. \n\nHere is the post that was written to `/home/ademar/projects/quirework/examples/room-book/room/seats/gus-firstpass/outbox/post.md`:\n\n\u003e Hey everyone. Since nobody has posted yet, I'll go first before anyone starts writing. I am just here to read the story. I don't know the fancy writer terms for voice or pacing, but I can tell you what I am hoping for in these three sections.\n\u003e \n\u003e For the preface: it says Prue is laying out the rules. I just want her to sound like a normal person talking to me, not reading a manual. Keep it short and funny like the brief says, or I am going to skim it.\n\u003e \n\u003e For chapter one: I want to feel why Mark is stuck. We have all been frustrated like that. This AI, Hal, sounds hilarious if he is totally wrong but totally confident. But with the editor, Em Dash, if she just comes off as mean, I might stop buying the setup. I want to feel the story moving forward, not bogged down in descriptions.\n\u003e \n\u003e For chapter two: the mystery about who wrote that one good sentence sounds like a fun hook. But do not drag it out. If it takes three pages just to check a computer log, I will get bored.\n\u003e \n\u003e That is what I will be watching for. I am just going to tell you plainly where I get confused, where I actually laugh, where I stop believing it, and where I lose interest. You guys can figure out the fixes.\n\nLet me know when the others have posted or if it's time to read their drafts!\n","duration_seconds":38.682650076,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":23842,"output_tokens":4350,"thinking_tokens":3404,"cache_read_tokens":40501,"total_tokens":28192}}}
